Traverse bounded declared configuration relationships around a resource

Usage: aws-inventory neighbors [OPTIONS] --scan-id <SCAN_ID> --resource-id <RESOURCE_ID>

Options:
      --db <DB>                    [default: inventory.sqlite]
      --scan-id <SCAN_ID>          
      --resource-id <RESOURCE_ID>  
      --direction <DIRECTION>      [default: both] [possible values: outgoing, incoming, both]
      --max-depth <MAX_DEPTH>      [default: 2]
      --max-nodes <MAX_NODES>      [default: 1000]
      --max-edges <MAX_EDGES>      [default: 4000]
  -h, --help                       Print help
